tinacloud-project-update-site-url-add(1) -- Add a site URL
==========================================================

## DESCRIPTION

Register a new site URL to the given project.

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud project update site-url add`

## OPTIONS

  * `--org-id`:
    TinaCloud organization ID

  * `--project-id`:
    TinaCloud project ID

  * `--tina-dir`:
    Path to the tina folder (default "tina")

  * `--url`:
    A URL to register against your TinaCloud project

  * `--json`:
    Print the result as JSON

## EXAMPLES

	$ tinacloud project update site-url add \
		--url "https://localhost:3000" \
		--url "https://mysite.com"

